  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "For the series' 20th anniversary, Game Freak's Junichi Masuda held signing sessions at Pokémon Centers across Japan from March 2016: Tokyo on 5 March, Hiroshima on 19 March and Fukuoka on 20 March, with later stops announced afterwards; places were drawn by lottery. Visitors got a holo Psyduck card, which Pokémon Centers also gave with booster pack purchases in May and June 2016.",
